00:03:24,480 --> 00:03:26,920
His parents have signed him up for merit badge events

38
00:03:26,920 --> 00:03:30,800
And I wonder if mom and dad are doing more than he is.

39
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:34,480
I know my role as scout master is to determine whether or not

40
00:03:34,480 --> 00:03:37,840
the merit badge counselor is registered before I sign the blue cards

