Ah well, that question should have the ring of familiarity with many of us.

50
00:04:09,720 --> 00:04:15,720
So before I offer any advice, ask yourself these two questions.

51
00:04:16,200 --> 00:04:19,000
Number one: did you choose your parents?

52
00:04:19,279 --> 00:04:23,160
And number two: if I tell you how to work with your children,

53
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:25,200
how would you react to that?

54
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:27,960
Would you welcome that as helpful advice,

55
00:04:27,960 --> 00:04:30,600
Or would you perhaps see it as something else?

56
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:33,920
So as you ponder the answers to those two questions,

57
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:38,200
I know it's difficult to figure out what we're able to do in some

58
