64
00:05:04,960 --> 00:05:08,760
And I'm not saying that all concerns are totally misplaced,

65
00:05:08,760 --> 00:05:12,840
but you have to put these in the context of what we're doing

66
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:18,240
and what the scouts doing and the parents, who he has not chosen, are doing.

67
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:24,040
So it's almost certain that the scout is not being harmed by doing

68
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:30,120
merit badges and what an individual parent chooses to do is not going

69
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:34,520
to harm the merit badge program. merit badge program is pretty resilient

70
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:37,200
But, as you noted, every time you sign a blue card

71
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:41,480
you have the opportunity to discuss what's going on with the scout

72
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:46,320
and just keep that casual and see if you can begin to understand

73
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:49,320
what he might be getting out of the whole process.

74
00:05:49,440 --> 00:05:52,800
Sometimes scouts get a lot out of the process,

75
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:57,680
Sometimes they get a little, and some are certainly

76
00:05:57,680 --> 00:06:00,120
collecting merit badges like Pokemon cards.

77
00:06:00,440 --> 00:06:03,000
Now you can think that that's good or that's bad,

78
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:06,200
But, like I say, is the scout being harmed by doing merit badges

79
00:06:06,200 --> 00:06:10,440
or is he able to inflict harm on the program itself?

80
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:11,920
Probably not.

81
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:16,000
None of us have the ability to look into another family

82
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:18,000
and see exactly what's going on.

83
00:06:18,120 --> 00:06:20,680
You may think the parents are overreaching,

84
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:23,600
being a little too ambitious or over involved,

85
00:06:23,760 --> 00:06:24,600
And you know what.

86
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:27,800
Sometimes that's the case, but they're trying to figure

87
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:30,240
things out as best that they can,

88
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:33,200
And the scout may be getting a whole lot out of this

89
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:36,040
that you don't see it first blush.

90
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:38,920
Going through the whole merit badge thing may be helping

91
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:42,840
him with any challenges he has so far as learning is concerned.

92
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:47,320
It could be helping him and his parents have an activity

