00:06:47,320 --> 00:06:50,520
that they can participate in together and that they enjoy.

94
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:54,280
I mean, we may never understand or know what's going on.

95
00:06:54,520 --> 00:06:57,080
Now there are rules, you know. like any game,

96
00:06:57,200 --> 00:06:58,080
There are rules.

97
00:06:58,080 --> 00:06:59,360
We follow the rules,

98
00:06:59,440 --> 00:07:02,160
And when it comes to evaluating who's doing the work

99
